      {
        "source_snapshot_id": "northstar-disclosure-a",
        "block_id": "statement",
        "text": "Northstar Medtech consolidated annual statements. Amounts in USD millions. FY2026 covers January 1, 2026 through December 31, 2026. FY2025 covers January 1, 2025 through December 31, 2025. Columns: FY2026 FY2025.\nNet income 32 32\nOperating cash flow 32 32\nGAAP operating income 14 12\nAdjusted operating income 19 16",
        "text_hash": "a25c44ea1bf6138c028e8b35610d8a5443ffd1937a0adbf1387c0b6e330feea9"
      },
      {
        "source_snapshot_id": "northstar-disclosure-a",
        "block_id": "note-detail",
        "text": "Note 3. For FY2026, adjusted operating income excludes restructuring charges of USD 2 million and litigation charges of USD 3 million from GAAP operating income of USD 14 million, producing adjusted operating income of USD 19 million. There are no other FY2026 adjustments in this measure. This definition is for adjusted operating income and does not redefine net income or operating cash flow.",
        "text_hash": "b4e514f30f5257fd7bfe8b37debfdb4000a05d9dbb26deab20331a18e335f9d6"
      }
    ],
